--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scientific attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The chip architecture and the instruction-set layer modelled in
chip_architecture.py and riscv_imc_workflow.py follow, with documented
deviations, the architecture described in:

    H. Zhou, Z. Zhou, S. Ren, J. Chen, Y. Li and X. Miao,
    "Heterogeneous Instruction Set Architecture for RRAM-enabled
     In-memory Computing", NANOARCH '23.

That paper is the source of the architectural ideas; no text, figures or
code from it are reproduced in this repository. Work that builds on this
toolkit should cite both the paper above and this repository (see
CITATION.cff).


